        "language": "english",
        "review": "It's definitely a fun little mystery/adventure game.\n\nI can't say it's hard and you are given clues constantly, but I do enjoy the interactions with the characters a lot.  Especially the main Duo.\n\nThe twist was nice too.  Didn't expect it.\n\nThe Moonicorns were adorable.  ^^\n\nI finished the game and saw that this game has \"FOUR Hidden Endings\".  o.o...  And here I thought it was linear.  Okay hmm...\n\nI found all the Moonicorns and got that Epilogue, but [spoiler]Keane leaves and they never confess to one another.[/spoiler]  D:\n\nUnless of course that's a hint at a sequel and that I got a pretty good ending, then I am all for it.  :D\n\nNow that I think back...  Did I accidentally choose a \"Career\" path.  Ahahah...\n\nWell, there is always room for a replay.  :>",
